{"items":[{"id":"472665141","root":"472665141","user":{"id":"10534479","name":"白忧解_Channel","avatar":"58d24cb5ae40e372da5096f7"},"text":"似浮萍聚与散皆不由人愿\n同行路又有几人能走完\n何须执手话离别泪眼相看涟涟\n不如醉笑千万场邀天上星斗来相伴\n人生事不称意放它逐风月\n盼只盼来日相逢如初见\n[emot=acfun,1833/]","time":1627881205566,"floor":844,"likes":6,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"472663798","root":"472663798","user":{"id":"1070404","name":"请叫我DJ","avatar":"03713873662b3586a8c54227"},"text":"最后能再唱首难忘今宵吗？[emot=acfun,1711/]","time":1627881075147,"floor":843,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"472659525","root":"472659525","user":{"id":"886896","name":"06279","avatar":"aa9230de4dd4f6bb8c86ba56"},"text":"2020年在我人生最糟糕的时刻，遇到了阿苇，第一次看打只狼的录播。就被深深吸引。随后开始翻以前投稿看。发现这人怎么这么有意思，上下班开车听阿苇的网易电台。喜欢看你打游戏气急败坏。我在屏幕后面嘻嘻哈哈，和钱二两的生化五没通，亚楠没通，茶杯头。jump king算了，需要投入太多时间学习。全战模拟器乌鸦哥，八分音符酱，命运之手出了2了。赌上啊美国运，和心中的玄一郎通宵大战8个小时09分57秒。还有好多好多回忆。博德之门roll 1。让直播间充满了欢笑。苇达影城。苇经理。希望你的稿件永远都在。谢谢你给我带来了这么多快乐的记忆。","time":1627880671430,"floor":842,"likes":11,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false,"replyPreview":[{"id":"472660334","root":"472659525","user":{"id":"886896","name":"06279","avatar":"aa9230de4dd4f6bb8c86ba56"},"text":"最后炫耀一下，阿苇的恰饭游戏，我还是比较幸运的carry 过一次。谢谢。苇。\r\n[img=图片]https://imgs.aixifan.com/content/2021_08_02/1627880688989.JPG[/img]","time":1627880747254,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":["8fa31119cf4a5313634ac498"],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"472661857","root":"472659525","user":{"id":"886896","name":"06279","avatar":"aa9230de4dd4f6bb8c86ba56"},"text":"对了，还有盗贼之海，双人成行。","time":1627880890882,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"06279","replyToUserId":"886896","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"472657595","root":"472657595","user":{"id":"235042","name":"半山植树","avatar":"a034c0be70edb2ade1684531"},"text":"电子船还会继续开，我会听着阿苇电台，等待下一次相遇。虽然不知何年何月，但船一直在开，总有一天我会在船上会再次听到开水声。\n一如天清月明，人聚人会散，愿接下来的三个月会成为我入土前最好的回忆。\n为此，我昨晚把家里的开水壶扔啦，换了成直饮，免得错过我熟悉的开水声。[emot=acfun,1678/]","time":1627880489852,"floor":841,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"472653633","root":"472653633","user":{"id":"514586","name":"水果罐头","avatar":"07c2758b808b75a6ee721523"},"text":"苇宝,我们在广阔的宇宙再见[emot=acfun,1707/]","time":1627880124824,"floor":840,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"472652975","root":"472652975","user":{"id":"8746004","name":"星月交辉の喜良","avatar":"aa9230de4dd4f6bb8c86ba56"},"text":"淦 ","time":1627880064708,"floor":839,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"472645723","root":"472645723","user":{"id":"1466686","name":"在万丈红尘中哦找个坦克来爱我","avatar":"87fa6f32d4af0080b44ab701"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1672/][emot=acfun,1672/][emot=acfun,1672/]","time":1627879381987,"floor":838,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"472644498","root":"472644498","user":{"id":"20533556","name":"mago_kawaii","avatar":"49d87eee3f52fef2a6b47974"},"text":"AC在，爱一直在[emot=acfun,1678/]","time":1627879266841,"floor":837,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"472641620","root":"472641620","user":{"id":"1465118","name":"村东头二狗子","avatar":"1db06908326c6bf928b1e25d"},"text":"谢谢你 疯女人","time":1627879003429,"floor":836,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"472640754","root":"472640754","user":{"id":"152949